          "text": "nĩvo mũndũ ũla wakomie nake amũnenge ĩthe wa mwĩĩtu sekeli mĩongo ĩtano sya vetha, nake natw’ĩke mũka wake, nĩkwĩthĩwa nĩwamũthũkisye; ndakaamũeke mĩthenya yake yonthe.",
